## Why "Hybrid" Is Better Than Either Alone

| Architecture | Temporal | Local Spatial | Global Context | Multi-Task |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Pure CNN (U-Net) | ❌ (2D only) | ✅ | ❌ (local only) | ⚠️ (single head) |
| Pure Transformer (ViT) | ❌ | ⚠️ (coarse) | ✅ | ⚠️ |
| LSTM + CNN | ✅ (slow) | ✅ | ❌ | ⚠️ |
| **VARUNA (Hybrid TransUNet)** | **✅ (3D Conv)** | **✅ (U-Net)** | **✅ (MHSA)** | **✅ (3 heads)** |

VARUNA is specifically designed to have **no blind spots** across all four dimensions of severe weather nowcasting.
